      "description": "<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-weight: bold\">Technical Sales Manager – Lab Instruments (North Central US)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">📍<span style=\"font-weight: bold\"> Chicago Area or nearby</span> | ✈️ 50–60% travel | 💼 Full-time, Exempt</span></p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-weight: bold\">Help the world’s food and agriculture leaders measure what matters.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">At KPM Analytics, our scientific instruments help companies protect product quality and brand value across food, agriculture, industry, environmental, and clinical markets. We’re looking for a seasoned capital equipment sales professional to own and grow our <span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Rheology, NIR, and Wet Chemistry</span> business across the North Central region.</span></p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Your territory:</span> KY, OH, IN, MI, IL, MO, IA, WI, MN, NE, SD, ND, plus Manitoba and Nunavut</span></p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-weight: bold\">What you’ll do</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">Own sales for your territory as the main point of contact for every customer</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">Hunt for new business and farm existing accounts, from prospecting and cold outreach to closed orders</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">Become a true technical and application expert on our product lines</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">Partner with Business Development Managers, engineers, and service to drive projects forward</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">Build quotes, shape customer specifications, and use value-based selling to win</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">Set and exceed your annual territory forecast, keeping Salesforce current weekly</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-weight: bold\">What you bring</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">10+ years of capital equipment sales experience in food, ag, chemical, or related industries</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">A bachelor’s degree in science or engineering (preferred) or a college certificate</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">A consultative, value-based selling style and the confidence to present to anyone, from lab techs to boards</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">Self-drive, strong communication, and a team-first attitude</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">Comfort working on-site in plants and labs (PPE, ladders, and catwalks included)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-weight: bold\">Why KPM?</span><br><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">You’ll represent trusted, globally recognized brands, have a large territory with real room to grow, and get the backing of a collaborative team that wants you to succeed and advance your career.</span></p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Compensation:</span> $110,000 – $120,000 base + commission</span><br><br></p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Benefits:</span> Health, dental, vision, 401(k) match, PTO, car allowance, etc.</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-weight: bold\">Ready to make an impact? Apply today.</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino\">KPM Analytics is an equal opportunity employer, we mean it, and we want people from all kinds of backgrounds on this team.</span></p>",
